@romseygeek I just added a [test case](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/97317/commits/0e347b76130dd0d1e11935719c44447e166fdeb4) that failed and emphasized the fact that other sequential merges should be covered as well within this PR. So I applied the new bulk-merge for `MetadataCreateIndexService` as well.

@piergm originally proposed to do this small refactor in a separate PR, but I now think it better be part of this one. 
Please look in https://github.com/eyalkoren/elasticsearch/pull/1 what I plan to migrate to the new merge API and let me know what you think.

